          <node TEXT="青年：您小时候被父亲殴打，所以关系才不好，这难道不是过去决定现在？" ID="uN1CuNSNfB" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%9D%92%E5%B9%B4%EF%BC%9A%E6%82%A8%E5%B0%8F%E6%97%B6%E5%80%99%E8%A2%AB%E7%88%B6%E4%BA%B2%E6%AE%B4%E6%89%93%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%80%E4%BB%A5%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E6%89%8D%E4%B8%8D%E5%A5%BD%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%99%E9%9A%BE%E9%81%93%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%BF%87%E5%8E%BB%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A%E7%8E%B0%E5%9C%A8%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" STYLE="fork"/>
          <node TEXT="哲人：我并非“因为被打所以关系不好”，而是“为了不与父亲搞好关系，才搬出被打的记忆”。也就是说，我先有了“不修好”这个目的，记忆只是被拿来当理由。" ID="kcJ2zpdH5q" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%93%B2%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9A%E6%88%91%E5%B9%B6%E9%9D%9E%E2%80%9C%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%93%E6%89%80%E4%BB%A5%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%B8%8D%E5%A5%BD%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%8E%E7%88%B6%E4%BA%B2%E6%90%9E%E5%A5%BD%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%8D%E6%90%AC%E5%87%BA%E8%A2%AB%E6%89%93%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%E4%B9%9F%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E8%AF%B4%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E5%85%88%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%86%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%8D%E4%BF%AE%E5%A5%BD%E2%80%9D%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%E8%A2%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%9D%A5%E5%BD%93%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" STYLE="fork"/>
