          <node TEXT="脸红恐惧症是“逃避告白”的借口" ID="sE4kQllY6Z" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E8%84%B8%E7%BA%A2%E6%81%90%E6%83%A7%E7%97%87%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9C%E9%80%83%E9%81%BF%E5%91%8A%E7%99%BD%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E5%80%9F%E5%8F%A3%3C/span%3E" STYLE="fork"/>
          <node TEXT="青年：那位女孩因为脸红恐惧症无法向心上人开口，这总归是生理问题吧？" ID="jT6JLB9evb" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E9%9D%92%E5%B9%B4%EF%BC%9A%E9%82%A3%E4%BD%8D%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%A9%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E8%84%B8%E7%BA%A2%E6%81%90%E6%83%A7%E7%97%87%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%90%91%E5%BF%83%E4%B8%8A%E4%BA%BA%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%A3%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%99%E6%80%BB%E5%BD%92%E6%98%AF%E7%94%9F%E7%90%86%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E5%90%A7%EF%BC%9F%3C/span%3E" STYLE="fork"/>
          <node TEXT="哲人：她最害怕的其实是被否定、失恋的打击。只要“脸红恐惧症”存在，她就可以告诉自己：“我之所以不能和他交往，都是因为这个病。”于是既不必鼓起告白的勇气，也能保留“如果病好了我也可以……”的幻想。" ID="ZBhdVJ3s3z" _mubu_text="%3Cspan%3E%E5%93%B2%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%9A%E5%A5%B9%E6%9C%80%E5%AE%B3%E6%80%95%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B6%E5%AE%9E%E6%98%AF%E8%A2%AB%E5%90%A6%E5%AE%9A%E3%80%81%E5%A4%B1%E6%81%8B%E7%9A%84%E6%89%93%E5%87%BB%E3%80%82%E5%8F%AA%E8%A6%81%E2%80%9C%E8%84%B8%E7%BA%A2%E6%81%90%E6%83%A7%E7%97%87%E2%80%9D%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%EF%BC%8C%E5%A5%B9%E5%B0%B1%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%89%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%EF%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E6%88%91%E4%B9%8B%E6%89%80%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%92%8C%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%A4%E5%BE%80%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E5%9B%A0%E4%B8%BA%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E7%97%85%E3%80%82%E2%80%9D%E4%BA%8E%E6%98%AF%E6%97%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%BF%85%E9%BC%93%E8%B5%B7%E5%91%8A%E7%99%BD%E7%9A%84%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E8%83%BD%E4%BF%9D%E7%95%99%E2%80%9C%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E7%97%85%E5%A5%BD%E4%BA%86%E6%88%91%E4%B9%9F%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E2%80%A6%E2%80%A6%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E5%B9%BB%E6%83%B3%E3%80%82%3C/span%3E" STYLE="fork"/>
